messages "misticalla**To: morrolanSubj: hiCc: misticallaDate: Aug  1Um, I was layin in bed thinkinabout you and then startedcrying my eyes out. I dont knowwhy for sure... I gues I feel badabout some things...I'm sorry forthe last few weeks. I know itsbeen hard.  I wish I couldmake it better.  I'm hurting insideand i'm sure you are too...dont forget me,shel**apocalypse**To: misticallaSubj: hiyaDate: Sep 23Hows things going with you? Hope they are well.Havent talked to you in ages.Please dont let linsolent or anybody else get to you because of meThere was a sexual harrasment case taken against me recently as I haveprobably told you in the past. People have tried to use this against mea lot recently and I was copping a lot of flak over it. There was an attemptto link it to things that have happened in the past by some people.Tuesday last week I was told of the universities official position on thecase against me. The final finding was that the seven pages of complaintsagainst me were unfounded and that the sexual harrasment case was animproper forum for the claims because there was nothing sexual about them.I would also like to add that the panel that arrived at these resultswas almost entirely female and had a strong feminist stance. I will betaking my own action against several people on this campus over what wasbasically a slag campaign and has totally fucked up several months of mylife. I really dont want to see other people getting attacked for stickingup for me. Those people are basically a bunch of deadhead fuckwits whichthe world would definately be better off without.As an important point warmaster is not gone. I asked for his name to be changed because of some of the shit that was going round and someoneobliged me. I dont know how legal that was but warmaster is now gizmo.This is only known by 3 people at the moment (including yourself) andI hope to keep it that way.I tried emailing you earlier on but our server is fucked and it bounced.We are looking at setting up a mud here soon. There is currently noplans for how it will run or what sort of game it will be etc. I mustalso add that we haven't even got permission yet although going ontalking to the people in the computing center there should be no problemswith that. I was wondering if you would be at all interested in helpingus setup the thing and if you had any ideas for a game. If you areinterested then email me at arco@blitzen.canberra.edu.au .I would liketo have you in with us because I know you wont fuckup or screw around.Its being blunt but its true :) . Too many of the people I see on hereand other games just fuck around. I'll keep you in touch with what hasbeen decided and how things are going. I have a large say in whathappens though because the machine it will be running on is one I own.Hope things are going well for you in real life as opposed to mud lifewhere there seems to be a lot going on that I dont know about that isn'treal nice. I hope your ok and not stressing about things too muchTake care of yourself ShellPaul**warlord**To: misticallaSubj: Mud marryDate: Jun 30Wanna get mud married?**bladecutter**To: misticallaSubj: heya backDate: Sep 24Somehow, my connection got severed, so if ya got the first messaage, this is going to seem repetative...However, if this doesn't look familiar, ignore the above two lines...Don't worry about missing my birthday... Being 24 sucks... Suggestion:Don't turn 24!!Second, How can ya have a heart attack about me having an accisent, when I haven't even told you about it yet?Makes me wonder how ya found out...  I guess I'm calling peoplein my sleep again... Would explain my phone bill, though :)But anyway, yeah, some lady decided to rear end my bike at 1am while i was on my way home from work back in May...Other than being broke, and having a sore back, I'm fine...And so is the bike :)So other than being broke (which is nothing new), and having a sore back (which also isn't anything new, either), I'm actually doing fine, which,if ya've been watching carefully fer the past couple years, is somethingnew :) Kinda sucks that i hafta get runover by a car, and put into a comabefore things start turning fine though, don'tcha think? Besides, i figured if anyone was gonna run me over, it prolly wouldhave atleast been one of you ladies from on here... After all i've putyou girls through, i think i deserve it :)Anyway, I'm outta here...Opps, almost forgot...How would i tell ya if yer not even on, anyway?Not like I coulda called ya while I was laying in the hospital unconcious, anywayJust being myself,Ian.**misticalla**To: bladecutterRe:   heya backCc: misticallaDate: Sep 25Yeah, I know, you cant call or email while in a coma -but Tuppy did tell me about you only a few days ago when i asked her ifshe'd seen/heard from you.I'm glad you're okay and I'm gladthat you seem to be doing better (in all aspectsof life, etc.Things are good here.  I am on ocasionally, but not as much as the days i had no life.Dont ask me how but that came out wrong.I lvoe typing messages when i cant see the words.  My telnet screen sucks.Thanks for lettin me know you're alive.  I miss you.Take care hon,Shelley**bladecutter**To: misticallaRe:   heya backDate: Sep 26Ahh, you've always had a life, you just din't realize it back then.But I do understand yer life now starting to get a bit overwhelming...Husbands, ya just have to keep your eyes on them at all times, don't ya? Otherwise they can get into so much trouble :)Heck, if ya think he's a handful, wait until you have yer first kid :)Remember all those times when your mom told you that she hopes you havekids just as rotten (if not worse) than you were to her?Guess what... It always comes true...Hence the reason why Grandparents always spoil them rotten :)Yet another way to get even... Not fair, is it? :)